{{Quote|I'm fresh out of tanks, your heinie! But I am bringing the heat!|Heatblast to [[King Xarion|King]] [[Dr. Viktor|Viktor]].<ref name="VTS">''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]''</ref>}}
Heatblast is one of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s most versatile transformations, having the power of pyrokinesis, meaning that he can create and influence the direction and form of fire. Heatblast can project streams of fire from his hands and mouth,<ref name="TT">''[[Tourist Trap]]''</ref> and can create fireballs he can throw or roll. He can also absorb both flames and heat, meaning that he can put out a fire just as quickly as he can start one.<ref name="WBC">''[[Washington B.C.]]''</ref><ref name="SAHBA">''[[Super Alien Hero Buddy Adventures (Episode)|Super Alien Hero Buddy Adventures]]''</ref><ref name="SP1">''[[Showdown: Part 1]]''</ref>{{Refn|[[:File:Heatblast 00.png]]|group = CN}} Additionally, Heatblast can enhance the power of his punches by coating his fists in fire,<ref name="Secrets" /><ref name="VTS" /> and can ignite his opponents or objects by touch<ref name="S23">''[[Store 23]]''</ref> or remotely, as seen when he set [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]]'s shoe on fire.<ref name="ATTW10" />

Heatblast's fire can burn hot enough to melt solid rock,<ref name="TUEP1">''[[The Ultimate Enemy: Part 1]]''</ref> a tank,<ref name="VTS" /> and a road.<ref name="Secrets" /> Heatblast can also use his fire in more creative ways, such as welding clumps of objects together<ref name="TA">''[[The Alliance]]''</ref><ref name="N10P2">''[[Ben 10 vs. Negative 10: Part 2]]''</ref> or making fireworks, as demonstrated by [[Gwen Tennyson (Gwen 10)|Gwen]] as Heatblast.<ref name="G10">''[[Gwen 10 (Episode)|Gwen 10]]''</ref> Additionally, he can spark fire fuses by snapping his fingers.<ref name="TA" /> His plasma blasts are hot enough to melt the hull of a warship in 10 seconds.{{Refn|[[:File:Heatblast Alien Creation Card.png]]|group = Bandai|name = Alien Creation}}

Heatblast is capable of projecting fire lasers, which he utilized to create an opening in the wall of a building.<ref name="WBC" /> Heatblast can also form large fireballs that function as bombs, which he used to destroy a planetarium that the [[Sparksville]] [[Nosedeenian (Classic)|Nosedeenians]] were possessing.<ref name="TT" />

Heatblast can create large pillars and vortexes of fire, which he can use to transport himself and civilians without burning them,{{Refn|[[:File:Heatblast Tornado Clarification.png]]|group = DR}} as shown when he saved [[Sumo Slammer Collecting Boy|a boy]] and his mother from a burning building;<ref name="WBC" /> transported himself on top of a subway train;<ref name="K11">''[[Kevin 11 (Episode)|Kevin 11]]''</ref> and when he transported [[Abel North|Kangaroo Kommando]] down to safety.<ref name="SAHBA" />

Heatblast can create constructs composed of fire, such as crescent-shaped weapons (referred to as "Fire Moons"){{Refn|[[:File:Protector of Earth Fire Moon.png]]|group = PoE}} that can be used to effortlessly slice through objects, such as several of [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]]'s [[Mechadroid|Mechadroids]];<ref name="Secrets" /> a fire dagger, which was used to slice through parts of [[S.A.M.]]'s water form;<ref name="MW">''[[Monster Weather]]''</ref> and fire disks that explode on contact.<ref name="SOTO"/>

Heatblast is capable of greatly amplifying the heat he gives off, which he used to melt out of Vilgax's electrical net;<ref name="Secrets">''[[Secrets]]''</ref> solidify [[Lenopan|Lenopans]];<ref name="BFAW">''[[Big Fat Alien Wedding]]''</ref> and flash vaporize the [[Fountain of Youth (Classic)|Fountain of Youth]], while also destroying a large portion of the cave he was in. The latter example was done by a 4-year-old Heatblast having a temper tantrum.<ref name="DDtW">''[[Don't Drink the Water]]''</ref>

Heatblast can create a small fire-board on which he can ride at high speeds.<ref name="TT" /> On this board, Heatblast can continuously circle his opponents to increase the temperature of his flames exponentially, as demonstrated when he used this technique to vaporize S.A.M.'s water form.<ref name="MW" /> After decent amount of practice, Heatblast is now capable of high-speed flight by propelling himself forward in the air.<ref name="Secrets" /><ref name="DAA" /><ref name="TBotE">''[[The Beginning of the End]]''</ref><ref>''[[A Jolt From the Past]]''</ref><ref name="Malefactor">''[[Malefactor]]''</ref> Additionally, Heatblast can fly by coating his entire body with fire, as demonstrated by [[Alan Albright|Alan]].<ref name="ETAtW">''[[Everybody Talks About the Weather]]''</ref>

Heatblast has the power of terrakinesis, meaning he can control earth. Heatblast can raise chunks of stone out of the ground to simply levitate above the ground, or to soar through the air.<ref name="VTS" /><ref name="TH">''[[Trouble Helix]]''</ref><ref name="T.G.I.S.">''[[T.G.I.S.]]''</ref><ref name="S23" /> This was first demonstrated when Ben taught Alan how to master his own flying abilities.<ref name="ETAtW" />

Heatblast has enhanced strength, enough to hold his own against [[Dr. Viktor]].<ref name="VTS" /> He was also able to lift debris of a building; rip off and buckle down the door of a car;<ref name="WBC" /> and stop a Wooden Bell from rolling, which was said to weigh heavier than 3,000 pounds.<ref>[[Natalie Alvarez]]</ref><ref name="Malefactor" />

Heatblast has enhanced durability, being able to survive getting thrown through multiple buildings at high speed by Vilgax with no damage.<ref name="Secrets" /> Heatblast was able to take multiple laser blasts from [[Malware]]<ref name="TH" /> and [[Rojo]].<ref name="TA" />

Heatblast is capable of jumping exceptionally high.<ref name="TFoC">''[[The Forge of Creation]]''</ref><ref name="VTS" />

Heatblast possesses fiery eyes that allow him to see in both total darkness and the brightest light.{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = Alien Creation}}

Heatblast can use his powers underwater, but at a lower intensity. Ironically, he can even breathe underwater despite being a fire-based alien.<ref name="SP1" />

Heatblast is immune to fire.<ref name="WBC"/> However, Heatblast has been shown to be hurt by the force of a fire attack.<ref name="K11" />

Heatblast is immune to being controlled by a [[Vladat]] via their [[Corruptura]], as he can burn them off his body with a small flare.{{Refn|[[:File:Corruptura Can Be Burned Off.PNG]]|group = DJW|name = Corruptura}}

Heatblast is resistant to being frozen within ice thanks to the high temperature he naturally produces, allowing him to thaw his way out of ice, such as ice created by an [[Ultimate Necrofriggian]]'s ice-flames.<ref name="TUS">''[[The Ultimate Sacrifice]]''</ref>

Due to being made of plasma and being constantly on fire, Heatblast glows in the dark like a candle.<ref name="K11" /><ref name="TBotE" />

Heatblast is capable of generating smoke, as demonstrated when he created a large cloud to psych out the Nosedeenians before they were able to get to him.<ref name="TT" /> He can also smack a body of water in order to create an offensive cloud of steam.<ref name="TSoDS">''[[The Secret of Dos Santos]]''</ref>

When infected with a cold, Heatblast's powers are completely inverted, making his pyrokinesis becoming cryokinesis (the ability to create and control ice), and he is constructed of icy fire rather than regular fire. While in this state, he could shoot blasts of ice from his hands that could freeze and cool down a nuclear reactor, and create blue "ice-fire" balls to encase and trap his opponents in.<ref name="SE">''[[Side Effects]]''</ref>

