{{Quote|Can't really fight fire with fire in this case.|Heatblast upon seeing Crabdozer being immune to fire.<ref name="Malefactor" />}}
Heatblast's fire attacks are ineffective against anything fireproof or capable of drawing strength from heat, such as [[Limax]],<ref>''[[Permanent Retirement]]''</ref> [[Tetramand (Classic)|Tetramands]], [[Petrosapien (Classic)|Petrosapiens]]<ref name="Framed"/><ref name="S23" /> [[Vaxasaurian (Classic)|Vaxasaurians]],<ref>''[[Above and Beyond]]''</ref> and especially [[Crabdozer|Crabdozers]],<ref name="Malefactor" /> and weapons and/or armor made from the latter's DNA.<ref name="SoY">''[[Stuck on You]]''</ref>

Because of his fiery body, on occasion, Heatblast cannot touch or hold anything in his hands without burning or melting it. He is also prone to burning where he sits<ref name="WBC" /> or accidentally leaving scorch mark footprints on certain floors.<ref name="DAA" /> Similarly, if Heatblast isn't careful, he may cause a fire that will accidentally go out of control and spread in certain areas.<ref name="ATTW10" />

If exposed to enough water,<ref name="TV">''[[The Visitor]]''</ref><ref name="SP1" /> wind<ref name="VoVP1">[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 1]]</ref><ref>''[[Absolute Power: Part 1]]''</ref> or fire-extinguishing substances (such as a fire extinguisher),<ref name="ATTW10" /> Heatblast's fire will be extinguished, though he can usually still reignite his flames almost instantly.<ref name="SP1" />

Being a Pyronite, Heatblast is at a massive disadvantage against a Crabdozer due to their fireproof skin and fire-suppressant saliva.<ref>[[Rook Blonko]]</ref><ref name="OPaP2">''[[Of Predators and Prey: Part 2]]''</ref>

Heatblast can get dizzy by flying around in a continuous circle at extremely high speeds.<ref name="MW" />

Heatblast is vulnerable to an [[Aerophibian (Classic)|Aerophibian]]'s neuroshock blasts, as demonstrated by [[Alan Albright|Alan]].<ref name="ETAtW" /><ref name="WXIP1">''[[Weapon XI: Part 1]]''</ref>

Despite his Corruptura immunity, Heatblast can still be controlled by Corruptura unless they are burned off his body.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = Corruptura}}

Heatblast cannot survive in the vacuum of space.{{Refn|[[:File:Heatblast cannot breathe space.png]]|group = DR}}

When under the effects of a cold, Heatblast's pyrokinesis is replaced with cryokinesis. Despite the new powers this gives him, Heatblast works completely "nonfunctional" to his fiery nature and the cold still prejudiced his health.<ref name="SE" />

===Non-Canon Weaknesses===
Heatblast can be killed if doused with huge amounts of water.{{Refn|group = AP|name = Code}}

==History==
===1773=== 
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', [[Skurd]] gave [[Mole-Stache]] Heatblast's maces to battle young [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]].

===Ben 10===
*Heatblast first appeared in ''[[And Then There Were 10]]'', where he, while testing his powers, accidentally started a forest fire, but stopped it afterwards by starting a second fire to extinguish both of them.
**The same scene occurred again in ''[[And Then There Was Ben]]''.
*In ''[[Washington B.C.]]'', Heatblast saved a mother and [[Sumo Slammer Collecting Boy|her son]] from a burning building and caught some crooks.
*In ''[[Permanent Retirement]]'', Heatblast defeated the [[Limax]] by blasting a pipe of water open to melt them underneath.
*In ''[[Kevin 11 (Episode)|Kevin 11]]'', Heatblast fought [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] and stopped him from crashing two trains, but got his powers temporarily [[Kevin's Pyronite Mutation|absorbed]] by him in the process.
*In'' [[Tourist Trap]]'', Heatblast battled and destroyed the [[Nosedeenian (Classic)|Nosedenians]]' planetarium before trapping them in a giant fishbowl.
*In ''[[The Alliance]]'', Heatblast saved a hospital from a landslide and defeated [[Rojo]].
*In ''[[Side Effects]]'', Heatblast, with a cold (forcing him to use ice instead of fire), defeated [[Clancy]] and his cockroaches and stopped a nuclear meltdown.
*In ''[[Secrets]]'', Heatblast defeated [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]]'s [[Mechadroid|Mechadroids]] before battling Vilgax himself, getting thrown at buildings but eventually immersing him in asphalt and coming out on top. Later, Heatblast escaped the [[Chimeran Hammer (Classic)|Chimeran Hammer]] before it exploded.
**Also, Heatblast appeared as one of the many alien templates used for Vilgax's army in an imaginary sequence.
*In ''[[The Big Tick]]'', Heatblast failed to defeat the [[Great One]].
*In ''[[Framed]]'', Kevin, in his [[Kevin's Framed Mutation|Framed Mutation]], as Heatblast defeated Ben as [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]] and later battled him as [[Four Arms (Classic)|Four Arms]] before switching into [[Stinkfly (Classic)|Stinkfly]].
*In ''[[Back With a Vengeance]]'', Heatblast appeared five times. Firstly, he was used when Ben unlocked the Master Control. Then, he appeared in a photo. Later, he was used to see which alien could spit the best loogie. Lastly, in the [[Null Void (Classic)|Null Void]], Heatblast was used twice to escape Kevin 11 and Vilgax and to fight a [[Null Guardian]].
*In ''[[Midnight Madness]]'', Heatblast destroyed a mall while sleepwalking.
*In ''[[Super Alien Hero Buddy Adventures (Episode)|Super Alien Hero Buddy Adventures]]'', Heatblast "saved" [[Abel North]] from a fake burning building before fighting him for the latter's show.
*In ''[[Monster Weather]]'', Heatblast defeated [[S.A.M.]].
*In ''[[The Visitor]]'', Heatblast was defeated by [[Xylene]].
*In the Red Edition of '''''[[Ben 10: Secret of the Omnitrix]]''''', Heatblast fought a [[Mutant Wasp]] and destroyed [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]]'s [[Devolution Bomb|DNA bomb]], defeating him and accidentally activating the Omnitrix's Self-Destruct Mode in the process.
*In ''[[Don't Drink the Water]]'', four-year-old Heatblast defeated [[Hex (Classic)|Hex]] and accidentally turned him into a baby.
*In ''[[Big Fat Alien Wedding]]'', Heatblast defeated [[Mr. Mann|Mr.]] and [[Mrs. Mann]].
*In ''[[Ben 10 vs. Negative 10: Part 2]]'', Heatblast made a barricade to the [[Mt. Rushmore (Classic)|Mt. Rushmore]] base.
*In '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens]]''''', Heatblast appeared thrice. Firstly, Heatblast attacked Ben in a dream. Then, Heatblast escaped from Ben's locker and flew home. Later, Heatblast was defeated and interrogated by [[Azmuth's Father|Retaliator]] before the Omnitrix switched him into [[Grey Matter (Classic)|Grey Matter]].
*In ''[[Survival Skills]]'', Heatblast made campfire even though he was told not to go alien. Since he didn't keep his promise, Max and Gwen used him as a campfire while he was trying to make one with rocks.
*In ''[[The Forge of Creation]]'', Heatblast battled 17-year-old Kevin, 16-year-old [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]], and 16-year-old [[NRG]] until he reverted.

===Five Years Prior to Omniverse===
*In ''[[Trouble Helix]]'', Heatblast battled [[Malware]].

