*In ''[[The Ultimate Sacrifice]]'', Heatblast melted and broke free from [[Sentient Ultimate Big Chill]]'s ice before switching into [[Brainstorm]].
*In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]'', Heatblast appeared as one of the many aliens when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was explaining his story to [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex]].
