*In ''[[The Secret of Dos Santos]]'', Skurd gave [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]] Heatblast's mace to battle [[Exo-Skull]].
*In ''[[Malgax Attacks]]'', Skurd used Heatblast's breath while Blukic and Driba tried to remove him from the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Heatblast appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

===[[Race Against Time Timeline]]=== 
*In '''''[[Ben 10: Race Against Time]]''''', Heatblast fought [[Eon]] and [[Eon's Minions|his minions]] while protecting the [[Bellwood (Classic)|Bellwood]] Police Department from them and seemingly obliterated the former.

===[[Original Future Timeline|Original Future]]===
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]'', Heatblast was defeated by [[Vilgax (Original Future)|future Vilgax]], so he switched into [[Stinkfly (Classic)|Stinkfly]].
*In ''[[Ken 10]]'', Heatblast battled [[Sploot]].

===[[Ultimate Alien Future Timeline|Ultimate Alien Future]]=== 
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', [[Ultimate Ben]] used Heatblast's pyrokinesis to fight [[Eon]].

===Gwen 10 (What If?)=== 
*In ''[[Gwen 10 (Episode)|Gwen 10]]'', [[Gwen Tennyson (Gwen 10)|Gwen]] as Heatblast wrote her name in the sky with fire, to [[Ben Tennyson (Gwen 10)|Ben]]'s chagrin (as he states, it took him a month to learn how to do that).

