==Trivia==
*Heatblast is the first alien [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] ever transformed into in the Classic Continuity and the entire franchise. Coincidentally, the first alien used in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' ([[Swampfire]]) also has pyrokinetic abilities like Heatblast.
**He was also [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin's]] first alien mutation, as well as both [[Gwen Tennyson (Gwen 10)|Gwen]]'s and [[Alpha]]'s first transformation. Coincidentally, [[Crabdozer]], the predator of [[Pyronite (Classic)|Pyronites]], is the first transformation used by [[Zed]].
**Furthermore, albeit being affected by Ben's cold in ''[[Side Effects]]'', he was the first alien with cryokinetic abilities, long before [[Arctiguana]] and [[Big Chill (Classic)|Big Chill]].
*Despite not appearing in '''Alien Force''', Heatblast's hologram can be briefly seen on the recalibrated [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] in ''[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 1]]''<ref name="VoVP1 Heatblast Hologram" /> and ''[[Busy Box]]''.<ref>[[:File:BB (397).png]]</ref> 
**[[Alan Albright|Alan]]'s [[Pyronite (Classic)|Pyronite]] form was used as the model.
**[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] believed that Heatblast was never used off-screen during '''Alien Force''', believing that Ben hadn't even unlocked him at that time.{{Refn|[[:File:UAF Characters Are Analogs to OS Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Heatblast can close part of his outer skin to avoid burning people, which explains why he can sometimes touch people and objects without damaging them throughout the franchise.{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = Alien Creation}}
*Among all of Ben's aliens who have eyes, Heatblast is the only one who never had green colored eyes.
**Concept drawings of '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s opening and ending credits incorrectly depicted Heatblast with green eyes.{{Refn|group = ca|[[:File:BEN10_ULTIMATEALIEN_02.png]]}} This was fixed in the final version.
*Heatblast was originally planned to be one of the playable aliens in the online game, ''[[Game Creator]]'', but was soon removed from the game when '''Alien Force''' aired.
*Heatblast is one of Ben's favorite aliens.{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: The Return of Heatblast]]''; [[:File:TRoH DVD Heatblast Data.png|file]]|group = DVD|name = dvd2}}
*Heatblast was created by [[Joe Casey]].{{Refn|https://preservetube.com/watch?v#&61;kU5Lz7cnK-g|group = JC}}
*Heatblast's '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''' design was made by [[Dave Johnson]], while his early rendition was called [[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)/Early Development#Inferno|Inferno]] and drawn by [[Steven E. Gordon]].
*Steve Blum did not reprise his role as Heatblast in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' because the crew did not have him in until the [[Incursean Invasion Arc|second story arc]].{{Refn|[[:File:Why Steve Blum Did Not Voice Heatblast in OV.png]]|group = DJW}}
*[[Bad Ben]]'s Heatblast would instead look exactly the same as his Prime Timeline counterpart but with the [[Omnitrix (Bad Ben's Timeline)|Omnitrix]] symbol recolored mint green.{{Refn|[[:File:Bad Ben Heatblast.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Heatblast was originally not supposed to defeat [[Dr. Viktor|King Viktor]] in ''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]''.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/f/f6/VTS_Script_First_Draft_V1_with_Dwayne%27s_Edits.pdf ''Viktor: The Spoils'' Script First Draft with Dwayne McDuffie's Edits (First Version)]|group = script|name = first1}}
*Gwen was originally supposed to transform into Heatblast instead of [[Clockwork]] in ''[[Inspector 13]]''.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/f/f1/Inspector_13_Script_DRAFT-1.pdf ''Inspector 13'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = script}}
*Heatblast is [[Steven T. Seagle]]'s{{Refn|https://preservetube.com/watch?v&#61;GJ1NT0Tie8M|group = STS}}{{Refn|https://youtu.be/7DBEawQ7P|group = STS}}; [[Duncan Rouleau]]'s{{Refn|https://youtu.be/IzdAJuPoKnU|group = DR}} and [[Tara Strong]]'s favorite alien.{{Refn|https://preservetube.com/watch?v&#61;kU5Lz7cnK-g|group = TS}}
*Derrick liked [[Steve Blum]] and [[David Kaye]]'s portrayals of Heatblast.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick liked OS and OV Heatblast voice.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Heatblast was the most challenging alien for David Kaye to voice.{{Refn|https://youtu.be/unaX1hKhOy4|group = DK}}

